         {
          "_key": "631e5b8",
          "cls": "elementor-widget-heading",
          "_type": "heading",
          "tag": "h3",
          "html": "Meet Dr. Neda Moezzi, DDS"
         },
         {
          "_key": "454cd4f",
          "cls": "elementor-widget-text-editor",
          "_type": "text",
          "html": "Hello, I’m Dr. Moezzi. To me, dentistry is about more than just treating teeth-it’s about building trust and forming real connections. I make it a priority to give every patient my full attention at every appointment, taking the time to listen, understand your goals, and create a plan that supports your long-term health and well-being. I graduated from the University of Detroit Mercy Dental School in 2010, and since then, l’ve continued to expand my skills in both general and advanced dentistry as one of the most sought-after dentists in Santa Clarita, CA. My ultimate goal is to make sure you feel comfortable, informed, and genuinely cared for—every step of the way. I look forward to meeting you."
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
